    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d603">

                <pb facs="0619" n="607" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg607"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00 Supreme Soviet/43: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-02-25T17:00:00+03:00">February 25,
                            1941—5 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 25—2:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>367. The eighth session of the Supreme Soviet of the Union of Soviet Socialist
                    Republics opened today and adopted as the agenda discussion of the 1941 budget
                    and the ratification of acts of the Praesidium since the last session.<anchor
                        n="29" xml:id="d603-f1"/> I attended the opening meeting.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d603-f1" n="29" xml:id="d603-f1-content">
                <p>The 1940 budget had been adopted at the sixth session of the Supreme Council,
                    March 29–April 4, 1940. The seventh session had been held August 1–7, 1940.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
